Z||000005||1FST2M6||03-20-2000||10:52 PM||||Ported, and Ceramic tape wrapped.. yes. I'm pretty sure the tape didn't make a darn bit of a difference but just had to toss it in there... The new one will be Jet-Hot coated by Custom Network Motors. and then slapped on the car... using the current exhaust... 2.5" cat and muffler, single in/out 2 Chamber Flowmaster. I have a new pair of solenoid but i'm gunna wait to install them till the first few dyno runs... Have the bigger "Race" series supose to flow better... let ya know about that too. Shooting for 8% for off the bottle and 10-15% on the bottle... I know those stock units are crappy...  Chris West called my house tonite... after checking his e-mail ".. just making sure everthing was still a-go and making sure your serious..." my reply... "sent the money order out today after lunch you'll have it by 10am tomorrow, thanks for the call.."||||reg||1
